	lv2:documentation """
<p>Poly Scope is a four-channel Hector oscilloscope utility with four audio
inputs, four direct-through audio/CV thru outputs, trigger controls, XY modes,
and a batched notify stream that feeds the custom digit_ui scope page.</p>
<p>The scalar sample and peak outputs remain available for lightweight host
monitoring while the custom UI is closed, so the module behaves like a normal
LV2 utility in the patch graph and only enables high-rate frame transport when
the dedicated scope page requests it.</p>
""" .
